heonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1272823-how-rare-archmages-or-powerful-masters-are?p=1276300#post1276300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bear in mind this was after the Avatar Storm had killed/disembodied tons of Masters and Archmasters.</div> </div> </div> </div>I prefer to head-canon / interpret that what happened was these Mages losing means of long-distance communication, ceasing contact, and/or going into hiding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 12-23-2018, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-24T02:25:12-08:00","id":1276405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>mark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1272823-how-rare-archmages-or-powerful-masters-are?p=1276253#post1276253\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> except.. if you look carefully at Malcolm's post it says .1% aka 0.1% meaning 12 archmasters which is just way to low imo</div> </div> </div> </div>Uh , I remember this 1% refers to Rabbit's : <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Undead Rabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Before the avatar storm the Euthanatos had no less than 6 archmages (Takstang, Senex,Voormas and the three more archmasters that lived on Cerberus), close to 1% total population of the Tradition.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just assume the most optimistic case referring to his description .<br /> <br /> And to be honest , ... I think this 0.1% is a little low (even after Avatar Storm) . Many experienced mages may avoid Storm efficiently. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1272823-how-rare-archmages-or-powerful-masters-are?p=1276306#post1276306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I prefer to head-canon / interpret that what happened was these Mages losing means of long-distance communication, ceasing contact, and/or going into hiding.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree this . Many Masters and Archmages are just trapped , not killed ( Although some do ).<br /> <br /> And those who survived Storm may prefer to hide ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24560,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","user":"Rock113","date":". 12-24-2018, 07:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24560-rock113","name":"Rock113","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24560